          "expr": "sum(rate(agent_tasks_total{outcome=~\"escalated|handback|degraded\"}[15m])) by (agent, outcome) / ignoring(outcome) group_left clamp_min(sum(rate(agent_tasks_total[15m])) by (agent), 1e-9)",
